In recent years, through the efforts of the Royal Government, the number of students enrolled in technical skills has increased significantly in schools under the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training. However, if you look at a well-known private technical school, "Kram Ngoy Center", the number of students is still small.
For more than 20 years, since 1998, the Kram Ngoy Center has been open for technical training to Cambodians, and so far a total of about 3,000 people. Technical students will surely know the reputation of this technical school through national competitions and national medals.
Kram Ngoy Technical Training School has two locations, one located at 58 Street 317 in Phnom Penh, not far from Olympic Market and the second location in Reay Dob Village, Siem Reap Commune, Kandal Steung District, Kandal Province. Siem Reap Kantuot is about 22 kilometers from Phnom Penh.
Covering an area of about 5 hectares, Kram Ngoy Center in Siem Reap Kantuot, although a bit far from Phnom Penh, but the location is really good, quiet, very conducive to study. Not only is the atmosphere good, the school has a wide range of study materials sponsored by international partners such as the Electricity of France (EDF).
An 88-year-old man who gave up his life in French civilization in Kandal Stung district, Kandal province, Professor Im Saroeun, President of Kram Ngoy Center Its listening to the tutorial.
Despite his old age, he is still strong and happy to transfer his knowledge, skills and experience to young Cambodians who love technical education, but unfortunately the number of students who are studying is Less yet.
Professor Im Saroeun, President of the Kram Ngoy Center, pointed out some of the reasons why young people do not want to learn technical skills, as this skill is standing at a high level, which is in high demand in the job market.
According to the professor, from the beginning, many students went to the Kram Ngoy Center to learn techniques, but over time, they became more and more. Factors that make students not want to study this field because:
He stated that in many learning centers, by studying the theory and practice. In the center, there are more learning materials than ordinary schools because we aim to be high, there are materials according to each section, which is why students come to study with confidence and believe that they can learn.
Dr. Im Saroeun claims that all students who graduate from the Kram Ngoy Guarantee Center do not have the word unemployment, because this center trains with the theory and practice that makes students strong to get a job.
