Mr. Soy Yen, Principal of Boeung Khnar Secondary School, also expressed his excitement when PRASAC built the library building for his school. He stated that this is a precious gift, incomparable and a great contribution to PRASAC society. Through this library building, he believes that students as well as people living nearby will have a wider opportunity to study more and improve their skills.
