She also urged people to take care of their health by eating clean and living clean, especially when they feel unwell, to go to the health center and hospital immediately to avoid going to unprofessional doctors. Proper or informal doctors who are not recognized by the Ministry of Health, and for young children to wash their hands thoroughly and do not hold food.
Heng Sok Kong, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Industry and Handicrafts and President of the Medical Federation of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, said that since the establishment of the Medical Union of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, we have visited and treated 110 people. More than 170,000 people out of 23 provincial capitals, and this is the 13th time for Kandal Steung district.
"For today, we have examined and treated more than 3,000 people, and if we focus on 16 diseases, we will also be distributing glasses and headphones for the deaf," he said. .
Deputy Governor of Kandal Province, Mr. Kim Rith, also thanked the leaders and members of the Medical Union of the Union of Youth Federations of Cambodia, who are always on duty to consider the health and well-being of our people, especially in Kandal Province. .
It should be noted that in Kandal Stung district, there is a referral hospital with 51 staff members and 6 health centers with 70 staff members, and poor people with equity cards receive free medical examination and treatment.
