(Phnom Penh): The criminal police force of the Po Sen Chey District Police Inspectorate arrested an elderly woman as she appeared to testify after being summoned by the criminal police officer of the Po Sen Chey District Police Inspectorate. This was confirmed by the police officer of Po Sen Chey district told Fresh News this morning, August 24, 2019.
Chheang Phalla, alias Pov, 47 years old, resides at 77, Street 123, Samaki 3 Village, Sangkat Trapeang Krasaing, Khan Por Sen Chey.
In June 2018, the woman bragged that she was a civil servant and had a line of senior officials at the Ministry of Interior. He then assured the victim to join the National Police, but after receiving the money, he spent it and did not run for the victim.
After realizing that she cheated on the woman, on July 5, 2019, the victim filed a complaint to the Trapeang Krasang Police Station for justice, and the police sent the case to the Po Sen Chey Criminal Division. It was not until August 22, 2019 that the district criminal police summoned the woman for questioning and arrested her.
