(Phnom Penh): Joint police forces cracked down on an illegal cosmetics packaging site at 14B, Group 8, Damnak Thom Village, Sangkat Steung Meanchey II, Khan Meanchey, collecting nearly 3,000 illegal cosmetics. Kg along with some other exhibits.
The crackdown took place on August 23, 2019 with the force of the Economic Crime Police Department of the National Police General Commission, Ministry of Interior, with the participation of officials from the Ministry of Health, local authorities and under the coordination of Mr. Kham Sophary. Deputy Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court.
After conducting a search, the joint police found about 2,700 kilograms of unlicensed products and chemicals used in the production of 11 types of cosmetics (packaging materials, packaging machines, cutters and colorants).
