(Phnom Penh): In order to contribute to the Royal Government in reducing the use of plastic and improving the health of the people of Arakha Housing, it will break 1,000 bowls for the participants to build houses on August 24, 2019 This is at the construction site, located on Street 23, Phsar Teuk Thla Village, Sangkat Teuk Thla, Khan Sen Sok, Phnom Penh from 6 to 7 am.
