Geng Shuang, a spokesman for the Chinese Ministry of Foreign Affairs, confirmed at a conference on August 20, 2019 that online gambling is like one of the most dangerous cancer tumors in modern society and is despised. By people from all walks of life around the world.
"The Chinese side is very pleased with Cambodia's decision to ban online gambling activities," he said. "We believe it will protect the interests of the people of the two countries and strengthen law enforcement cooperation and enhance friendly relations between us."
