(Phnom Penh): After the 2019 Higher Secondary Diploma (Bakdup) Examination was successfully completed on the evening of August 20, 2019, Dr. Hang Chuon Naron, Minister of Education, Youth and Sports, released a video thanking the officials. Educate all levels and all stakeholders who take care to complete the tasks in the exam process.
Please note that the writing process of the Higher Secondary Diploma Examination and Completion Exam Session: August 19, 2019 was successfully completed and there were no significant incidents. This is according to a press release issued by the Ministry of Education on the evening of August 20.
The Ministry of Education confirmed that the writing process of the Higher Secondary Diploma Examination and Completion took place over two days, on August 19-20, 2019, with a total of 117,043 candidates, 60 females, registered. 427 students and 202 examination centers. There are 75 science classes and 127 social science classes with 4,725 rooms nationwide.
The Ministry of Education stated that "the high school diploma exam on August 19, 2019 went well and smoothly and there were no significant irregularities due to the candidates who adhered to the rules of the exam well, almost no lead "Arrested copies of documents and prohibited equipment."
Although the weather in some provinces was very hot and rainy, it did not affect the candidates' writing process. Candidates made 2 mistakes, in which case the phone was confiscated in 1 case and the copy of documents was imported in 1 case.
Separately, 152 candidates with health problems after receiving first aid can continue the exam, except for 11 cases sent to the hospital can not return to continue the exam.
