(Tbong Khmum): Mr. Cheam Chansophoan, Governor of Tbong Khmum Province, this morning, August 19, 2019, passed the Higher Secondary Diploma Examination (Bakdup) at Samdech Techo Hun Sen Suong High School in Suong City, Tbong Khmum Province. At the same time, the provincial governor also announced an incentive for students who pass the A-level exam with a laptop.
