Mr. Cheam Chan Sophoan continued that the efforts of the young people are for the future and honor for themselves, for their families and for the society.
He encouraged all young people who are candidates for the Higher Secondary Diploma (Bakdup) not to be afraid and to have self-confidence and respect the regulations of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports.
