Five Immigration Police Officers in a Car Crash Kill 4 in Teuk Chhou District, Kampot Province
(Kampot): Five immigration police officers in the same car collided with a cement trailer without lights, killing four people.
The accident happened at 3 am on August 19, 2019 at the point between the 4th and 5th km on National Road 33 in Trapeang Thom village, Chum Kreal commune, Teuk Chhou district, Kampot province.
The driver of the cement trailer escaped from the scene.
