Mr. HUN Manet: Samdech Techo HUN SEN still has ambitions to make the country more prosperous and wants the people to be more prosperous
(Kampot): Speaking from Kampot province, Mr. HUN Manet stated that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, still has ambitions to make the country more prosperous, make the people more prosperous and want the descendants of the people. Citizens are richer.
This statement was made on the occasion that Mr. HUN Manet, Representative of Samdech Techo HUN SEN and Samdech Kittipritthbandit, attended the groundbreaking ceremony and inauguration of achievements of Wat Po Reach Lum Pu in Boeung Thom Khang Lech Village, Ang Suraphy Commune, Kampong Trach District. Kampot province on August 17, 2019.
Mr. HUN Manet said that Samdech Techo Hun Sen still has ambitions to make the country more prosperous, make the people more prosperous and want the descendants of the people to be more prosperous. This is the goal of the leadership of Samdech Techo, head of the Royal Government of Cambodia and the Cambodian People's Party. Today's achievement is one more achievement, adding to the many achievements we have built in all areas.
Mr. HUN Manet added that the next goal is to expand employment opportunities, learning opportunities, livelihood opportunities to be better. The most important thing is the peace that we strive to find and maintain, leaving the next generation free from war. We are all in the same direction to help our people grow, maintain peace, build more achievements.
At the same time, Mr. HUN Manet also said that maintaining peace depends on two main factors: First, the leaders who lead the country by the principle of national unity do not paint each other to fight each other. Second, the people involved in maintaining peace, if people do not participate and people are drawn into something that destroys the peace, we can lose.
He said that the leadership of the Royal Government since 1979 as a single Khmer, despite the majority, Samdech Techo Hun Sen does not care which party or party, we together build the country to grow and have Happiness as it is today.
Mr. Hun Manet continued that our abundance is in peace in our hearts, in our feelings, as the basis in building a prosperous country, which is the basis on which we love, respect and discriminate. Together we build, and we join together to keep the peace, not to fight, not to divide the land, so that there will be no war of any kind.
"This is the sole purpose of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the head of the Royal Government," he said. Let the people trust the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, as long as the people continue to support him, he will strive to maintain peace, unite the nation, build the country to continue to grow.
