President of the Constitutional Council: The death of Mr. Seuy Keo is the loss of dignitaries, sacrificing physical and mental strength for the cause of the motherland
(Phnom Penh): The President of the Constitutional Council, Mr. Im Chhun Lim, expressed his deep sorrow and grief over the death of General Suy Keo, Senator.
In his condolence letter to his family on August 17, 2019, Mr. Im Chhun Lim considered the death of Mr. Seuy Keo as the loss of a dignitary who sacrificed his physical and mental strength for the cause of the motherland.
His body was laid to rest at his home in Boeung Kanseng commune, Banlung city, Ratanakkiri province.
