(Phnom Penh): The nationwide traffic law enforcement campaign for August 17, 2019, the traffic police force inspected 3,554 vehicles, found 691 vehicles violated the law (63% motorcycles), 384 education vehicles and fined 307 units, according to the official report of the General Commission of the National Police.
According to the report, 1,802 helmets and goggles were inspected on August 17, 258 education helmets and 307 glasses were fined.
