(Phnom Penh): A man driving a high-speed luxury car crashed into an Indian tuk tuk and two motorcycles, causing a serious injury in Sen Sok district.
The incident happened at more than 12 o'clock on August 18, 2019 along Samdech Chea Sim Street in front of Boeung Baitong Market in Sangkat Kork Khleang, Khan Sen Sok, Phnom Penh.
