Regarding the amendment of the law, she reported to the Minister that with the good cooperation of all stakeholders, the process of drafting the law went smoothly and achieved good results, and hopefully can be completed by the end. This year 2019. In particular, for the request for a general assessment project in the agricultural sector, FAO will review and discuss with other partners to have rules and participate.
