(Pailin): A delegation of Pailin province led by Mr. Thou Phea, Deputy Provincial Governor, on the afternoon of August 15, 2019, attended a meeting with Pong Nam Ron District Governor and relevant officials of Chan Borei Province, Thailand to prepare for the cycling event. Friendship and good cooperation between the provinces bordering Cambodia-Thailand, with the participation of more than 2,000 athletes at Ban Lem, Pong Nam Ron District, Chan Borei Province, Thailand.
