Information technology under the vision of Metfone is a necessary element of the current Digital Transformation era, including education. In order to facilitate information technology for study and training, this laboratory has contributed to strengthen information technology skills under the guidance of the Royal Government of Cambodia.
With this knowledge, Metfone has submitted proposals to various ministries and the Fund for Capacity Building, Research and Development in the Telecommunications, Information and Communication Technology (CBRD) to establish these laboratories in many high schools over the next three years (2019). - 2021) on 20 high schools in 13 provinces across the country.
Speaking at the opening ceremony, Mr. Hoeung Kuch Chandara, Deputy Director of Metfone, said, “Metfone would like to thank the Ministry of CBRD for paving the way for Metfone to complete the establishment of two out of 20 schools. Metfone is committed to completing the work of 18 more schools in September 2019 to be handed over to the Ministry of Education before the new school year arrives.
