The provincial governor said that the people must cooperate with the authorities to maintain security and public order, such as travel, theft or drug offenses, etc., although this work is the duty of the authorities, but without the participation of the people. Can not succeed.
At the same time, the people must clean the house and help clean the resort or public road better, otherwise it may cause a bad environment, affect health and damage the beauty of our city. Also. This is an additional confirmation from Mr. Un Chanda.
