The forum was held on the afternoon of August 14, 2019 at Sangke District Hall with the participation of the director of the relevant specialized departments, district governors, district councils, armed forces, civil servants, commune councils, people in some communities.
Mr. Nguon Rattanak stated that the management and distribution of water use through the Kanghat irrigation system, which is distributed to the rice fields of the people in the communities in the communes, we have to follow the schedule set by the officials and we have to implement it. According to three principles, including:
* First: The use of irrigation water is to do as much as possible * Second: Can our brothers do it? If we use water by dividing it by rotation * Third: We need to study the geography of good water use, please do not dig the main canal to pump water, it will damage our canal and lose order and loss. All of us.
On that occasion, the delegation allowed the commune chiefs and village chiefs to have opinions and suggestions to the chairman of the working group and other suggestions to help solve them as well.
Mr. Kol Vireak summed up and resolved some concerns and problems for the community that there are 3 points, including:
* First: Want to have a clear water management committee * Second: The district governor is the chairman of the water management committee * Third: For the success of all.
