A heavy truck overturned and fell into a container across the road in Tbong Khmum district, but fortunately no one was injured
(Tbong Khmum): A container truck overturned on its own, causing a container to fall across the road on National Road 7 at Cheung Kal village, Mong Rieu commune, Tbong Khmum district, Tbong Khmum province, but fortunately did not cause any casualties. No one was injured, only causing traffic jams on the road.
According to the people there, the above incident happened from 12 pm on the 13th to the 14th of August 2019 until 8:40 am on the 14th of the month. This August, the car was towed from the scene and the traffic returned to normal.
Currently, the vehicle was severely damaged and was called by a professional crane to be stored at the Tbong Khmum District Police Inspectorate to question the driver and check documents related to the vehicle.
5 suspects arrested, confiscated baht and some Cambodian money
