Police said the suspects arrested included:
1. Roeun Phon, alias Tnaot, male, 17 years old, Cambodian, with uncertain occupation, was imprisoned in Kandal Province for 6 months for stealing. 2: 2: Name: Roeun Chanthou, female, 36 years old, Cambodian. 3: Name: Kin Rina, male, 15 years old, Cambodian. 4. Name: Bun Rath, male, 26 years old, accomplice. 5. Name: Koam Chan, male, 41 years old, Cambodian, fleeing. Village, commune where the incident took place.
