Kampong Cham Provincial Police Commissioner Major General Em Kosal said this morning, August 14, 2019, that after receiving this information, he ordered the fire brigade to remove four vehicles, including one vehicle from Kampong Siem district and Three provincial police vehicles immediately launched an operation to intervene.
