Britain sends another warship to the Persian Gulf to join US reconnaissance mission
The move comes after London enlisted in a joint venture plan to maintain security in the Persian Gulf proposed by Washington amid tensions with Iran. The United States made the request after Tehran seized a British oil tanker in the Strait of Hormuz in the Persian Gulf, apparently in retaliation for Britain's capture of an Iranian tanker in the Gibraltar Strait.
In this joint international effort, the United States has called on its European allies Europe, France and Germany, as well as in the Asia-Pacific region, such as Japan, South Korea and Australia, to join, but some have refused and some are reluctant.
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng Recommends 5 Points on Legal Work in Ministries and Institutions
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Interior and Chairman of the National Committee for Sub-National Democratic Development, made five recommendations to the Forum on Legislative Functions and Reform of the Royal Government for Implementation. Work efficiently and as scheduled.
Recommendations of Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng presented at the forum on the function of legislation and reform work of the Royal Government on the afternoon of August 13, 2019 include:
* First, encourage the organization of a forum on legislative functions and reform work of the Royal Government on a regular basis once a year to become an approach for gathering ideas and sharing good experiences to find common solutions. On reform and legislative work.
* Second, request the Legislative Council of the Ministry of Economy and Finance to cooperate with the Secretariat of the Four Reforms and the Legal Units of the Ministries and Institutions to discuss the results of this forum and prepare mechanisms and measures to increase the efficiency of the Royal Government. In particular, reform and legislation.
* Third: We have all recognized that the function of the legislature is really necessary to support the reforms of the Royal Government, therefore, each ministry must establish a specific institutional mechanism for the legislative work to participate. And support the work of the four core reforms and sector-specific reforms.
* Fourth, in order to ensure active participation and effective support for the reform work, the legislative units of each ministry and institution need to strengthen the capacity of their units to have a clear work plan and a specific action plan.
And 5: Ministries, Institutions, Legislative Units of each Ministry must continue to review and adjust the policies, strategies and legal documents in their respective fields to be accurate, clear and effectively respond to the four core reforms of the Royal The government.
