Thmor Kral Waterfall Natural Resort is located in Koh Khtom Village, Chiep Commune, Teuk Phos District, Kampong Chhnang Province. If you travel from Phnom Penh on National Road No. 5 to Teuk Phos District around School No. 5, Thmor Kral Waterfall Natural Resort is located on the left hand side of this road, that is, this resort is located in the western part of Kampong Chhnang Province, about 50 Km.
