Mr. Som Oun continued that in 2020, civil servants and workers will lose 6 days off, but what we get back is to provide a competitive environment, attract investors, create new jobs. And ensure the strength of the national economy. He said that the National Confederation of Trade Unions has already announced that it is ready to join the Royal Government of Cambodia in the reform of social justice and national economic reform.
