On that occasion, Mr. Keo Remy, Minister Delegate to the Prime Minister and Chairman of the Cambodian Human Rights Committee, urged the three candidates to train more to gain victory for the motherland and be appointed. Keep in mind that going to this game is not for yourself and your family, but for the whole nation.
