(Kampong Cham): In the vaccination ceremony of cattle to prevent various diseases this morning, August 12, 2019 in the third village, Koh Samrong commune, Kampong Siem district, Kampong Cham province, Mr. Un Chanda, Governor of Kampong Cham province said. Although today is rich in machinery, cattle are still an important driving force for farmers in agriculture in Kampong Cham.
