"The Thai Post is pleased to be working with and working with Tuxitopi on other projects," said Phisanuwan Chapol, Senior Vice President of Business Development. We believe that easy2send will be the most successful remittance service of TwoCTP. "We will help all non-Thais working in Thailand to send money legally and safely."
