Senior Minister Kun Kim, First Vice-Chairman of the National Committee for Disaster Management, told Fresh News this morning, August 10, 2019, that the budget was sponsored by Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit and will be handed over to his family. The body was handed over this morning.
According to the Senior Minister, in addition to bringing money to the families of the dead, today he will visit to solve flood problems in Lumphat and Kon Mom districts. About 1,000 families in Kon Mom district are also threatened by severe floods.
