Apparently, due to the high heroism that can not be priced by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, only now is our country now peaceful and has many human resources who have the opportunity to graduate at all levels, both in the country and abroad. We must also remember that in the future, you can also become an important human resource to contribute to the development of our country to be more advanced as a civilized country in the ASEAN region and the world.
