(Ratanakkiri): While the floods are raging in Lumphat district, Ratanakkiri province, causing flooding in local roads in Chey Udom village, Chey Udom commune, and people brought boats to cross each other suddenly crossing the water The boat sank and a girl went missing.
According to Senior Minister Kun Kim, the authorities and the people are now intervening to find the missing girl. "There was a child who died because he neglected to cross the bridge by boat. We forbade him to do so, but he still wanted to cross, endangering the life of a child," he said.
Senior Minister Kun Kim pointed out that there was a roadblock at the scene and the authorities had banned people from passing through, and he expressed his deep regret over the incident.
