Be careful! National Road No. 45 collapsed in Ream commune, Prey Nob district, between km 7-8 due to flooding
(Preah Sihanouk): Flooding and rain caused a landslide on National Road No. 45 between km 7-8 in Ong Ream village, Prey Nob district, Preah Sihanouk province on the morning of August 9, 2019. This. This is according to the broadcast of the Secretariat of the Marine Base.
