On the morning of August 08, 2019, Mr. Yit Sunnara encouraged the participants to attend a training workshop on dengue education at Prey Veng Provincial Health Department with the participation of Dr. Chim Hao, Deputy Director of Prey Veng Provincial Health Department, and 138 other doctors.
Dr. Chim Hao mentioned about the report of dengue fever in Prey Veng province that as of the week of January 1 to the week of August 31, 2019, there were 224 cases of dengue fever compared to the same week. In 2018, there were only 18 cases.
Mr. Yit Sunnara expressed his appreciation and appreciation for the professional efforts of all doctors in Prey Veng to treat patients and especially those with dengue fever. All have slowed down and will not continue to happen.
On that occasion, Mr. Yit Sunnara also visited the Provincial Referral Hospital to check the activities and visit the health of the people who came to be treated at the Prey Veng Provincial Referral Hospital.
