(Phnom Penh): General Dr. Neth Savoeun, General Commissioner of the National Police and President of the Friends of the National Police Association of Cambodia, on August 08, 2019, assigned Major General Em Kosal, Provincial Police Commissioner of Kampong Cham to hand over a gift to Mr. Nuon Samin. Former Kampong Cham Provincial Police Commissioner and currently Assistant to Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum.
Major General Em Kosal said that Nuon Samin was being treated in the emergency room of Calmette Hospital. After receiving this information, General Dr. Neth Savoeun assigned him to bring donations and funds from the Friends of the Kampong Cham Provincial Police to support Nuon Samin's family with a total budget of 5 million riel.
Speaking on that occasion, Major General Em Kosal also brought a message from the General of the National Police as well as all officials under the Kampong Cham Provincial Police and wished Mr. Nuon Samin a speedy recovery. Also.
