(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training has started to implement the modernization strategy of the Vocational Technical Education and Training System (TVET) and issued recommendations urging all educational institutions under its supervision to pay attention to the implementation of this strategy. Effectiveness to trainees in response to advances in modern technology or so-called Industrial Revolution 4.0.
