The Royal Government delegation stressed that the overcoming of a small number of tactics by this opposition political group has caused the price of electricity in Cambodia to fall continuously, from about 4,000 riel to between. 350 Riel to 610 Riel. That is why the Royal Government is doing everything in its power to bring this price down.
