(Kampong Thom): Major General Som Sun, Commander of Kampong Thom Military Operation Area and President of Kampong Thom Provincial Cambodian Veterans Association, on Sunday, August 4, 2019, continued to lead his colleagues, local authorities and residents to hand over new houses. Of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, President of the Cambodian Veterans Association to Mrs. Phuong Navy Veterans at Kampong Thom Provincial Military Unit.
