Preah Vihear Provincial Governor Calls on Civil Servants, Armed Forces and Citizens to Join in Peacekeeping
(Preah Vihear): Mr. Prak Sovann, Governor of Preah Vihear Province, called on all civil servants, the Armed Forces and all citizens to participate in maintaining peace and stability for a long time for the nation to develop further. More.
The Governor of Preah Vihear Province said this on the occasion that he, along with Mr. Long Sovann, Chairman of the Provincial Council, leaders of the Armed Forces, civil servants in departments around the province, attended the closing ceremony of the 36th generation (12 + 2) primary school teacher training course. At Preah Vihear Provincial Teacher Training College on the afternoon of August 3, 2019.
Mr. Prak Sovann stated, "We call on all of us to take part in maintaining this peace for a long time so that our country can be more developed for the future of our descendants." "
