According to General Lim Sokharaksmey, the National Police General Commission considers the private security sector as an important sector that must actively contribute to maintaining security, social order, as well as protecting national interests and national development because the security agencies As an auxiliary force to help stop the perpetrators, they must immediately report to the competent authorities to hand them over to the authorities for legal action.
