(Kampong Thom): Speaking on the occasion of Kampong Thom Provincial Administration organized a tree planting day on July 31, 2019, Mr. Sok Lou, Provincial Governor, confirmed that all relevant skills must not answer each other on forest crime.
Mr. Thiv Vanthy, Director of Kampong Thom Provincial Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, reported that the planting of seedlings today in the area of 3 hectares, there are 300 seedlings of Thnong, 300 Neang Nuon, 300 beng, 300 Kranhong and 700 seedlings for the needs of the people, a total of 1,900 trees. All saplings are planted in the Kbal O Kranhak community forest in Tbong Teuk village, Mean Rith commune, Sandan district.
