A fabric warehouse was completely engulfed in fire in Bati district, Takeo province
(Takeo): A fabric warehouse with about 20 tons of fabric was completely engulfed in flames due to a power outage. This incident happened on the afternoon of July 31, 2019 in Kraing Leav commune, Bati district, Takeo province.
