2: Participated in meetings with the National Committee for Promoting Village Movement 1 Product 1, the National Training Committee, the National Committee for Agricultural Contracts and many other public institutions.
Each cluster has defined specific missions, objectives and action plans for execution in training business management skills to achieve common goals and strategic plans focusing on the development of Cambodian business in terms of quality, capacity and competitiveness in the international market.
