According to the source, a total of 48 countries have been granted visa-free travel, while the United States, Australia, South Korea, Canada, Singapore, New Zealand, Malaysia, Switzerland, Denmark, Sweden, Norway, Finland, Iceland, Russia, the United Kingdom, China, India, Thailand and the United States. Cambodia is one of them.
