(Koh Kong): Mr. HUN Many, Chairman of the Committee on Education, Youth, Sports, Cult, Religious Affairs, Culture and Tourism of the National Assembly (7th Committee) 4 In charge of the commission on the morning of July 29, 2019.
Mr. HUN MANY said that local development always has problems and challenges, so it requires the provincial leaders and all professional officials to continue to work hard and pay attention, turning the challenges into opportunities to be Benefits and priorities for the people.
The Chairman of the Commission encouraged the provincial administration to evaluate the actual situation at the local level, identify challenges, set clear action goals to propose solutions from the national level, because the national guidelines set out to implement. Overall, that does not necessarily fit the context in the province as a whole.
