(Phnom Penh): A suspect stole a motorcycle lock and was unable to ride, dragged and ran on the road, but was immediately arrested by the owner and handed over to the Chaom Chao 1 Police Station for questioning in order to build a case for legal action. The legal way.
The incident happened on July 29, 2019 behind Ekareach 1 Market in Trapeang Thleung 1 Village, Sangkat Choam Chao 1, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
According to the police officer of Choam Chao I, the suspect is You Makara, 18 years old, living in Trapeang Thleung 2 village, Sangkat Choam Chao 1, Khan Por Sen Chey, while the victim is Ou Phearith, 49 years old, factory worker, living at house No. 2Eo, Trapeang Thleung 1 village, Sangkat Choam Chao 1, Khan Por Sen Chey. As for the motorcycle that was stolen, it was a 1996 model, navy blue, with license plate number D-4919 PHO1.
Police said that before the incident, the victim left the motorcycle in front of his house, while the suspect went into the act of stealing locks, but the motorcycle did not burn, he also dragged away. Body.
The victim, after realizing that the motorcycle had been stolen, went out to look for it and found the suspect dragging the motorcycle about 300 meters from the house, shouting. At that time, the villagers came to help chase and catch him immediately and then handed him over to the Chaom Chao 1 police station for questioning in order to build a case for legal proceedings.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen: Arrest of 3 Cadastral Officials in Pursat Province for Corruption (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, stated that the reason why the Anti-Corruption Unit arrested officials Three cadastre officials in Pursat province were convicted of embezzling $ 100,000 from the builders in exchange for permission to build a factory.
This statement of Samdech Techo Hun Sen was made this morning, July 29, 2019, on the occasion of Samdech inspecting the construction site of the "Techo Heritage" National Stadium and meeting with workers, leaders, sports officials and Many other female athletes.
On this occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that as the government uses the fifth "surgery" approach, which is one of the five approaches to apply to corrupt officials who have misused their position on behalf of As a public servant, from today onwards, any official who violates the law, the Anti-Corruption Unit must fulfill its role by arresting all those officials immediately.
The head of the Royal Government of Cambodia said: "As for the case of arresting three officials from Pursat, it is necessary to build a factory. I was the one who went to announce the factory there, so they asked to build it. It's too late until later, I worked with the Anti-Corruption Unit, Om Yentieng, to look at the research, see less, let the officials come in and pretend to be the owners of the company, it doubled the price from 50,000 to 100,000. "
The head of the Royal Government of Cambodia said that for the process leading up to the arrest of the three officials, after the officer demanded a deposit of $ 5,000, the ACU official who disguised as a company also deposited $ 5,000. Negotiations then led ACU officials to reserve another $ 4.5,000 for 50 percent of the cadastral officials' compensation in exchange for permission to build the plant.
