Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of inspecting the construction site of "Moradok Techo" stadium
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of July 29, 2019, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, inspected the construction site of the “Techo Heritage” National Stadium and met with many workers, leaders, sports officials and athletes. Another image.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the construction of the Techo Heritage National Stadium, a large building in Cambodia, is the result of Cambodia-China cooperation as part of the Belt and Road Project.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his gratitude and appreciation to Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh and Mr. Thong Khon for their efforts to pay attention to the construction process of this stadium.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that Cambodia does not discriminate against any country's aid. But there are some countries that come out to help Cambodia like this.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen further questioned who came to help meet Cambodia's needs, such as the construction of the Sekong Bridge and the Mekong River crossing in Stung Treng, Prek Tamak, Stung Trang and Kroch Chhmar bridges, and the study of another bridge in Kratie to Connect Kratie to Kampong Thom.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that National Road No. 10 connecting Samlot, Battambang to Koh Kong will be opened soon.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen questioned critics of Cambodia-China relations, what does it mean to be permanently neutral?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Techo Heritage National Stadium still needs to build more buildings, and Cambodia is open to countries willing to come and help, not that Cambodia only takes help from China.
* Samdech Techo explained that the reason why there are so many workers and technicians at the construction site is because Cambodia can not supply workers and techniques.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that China does not want to bring workers and technicians to work, but because Cambodia lacks workers and technicians.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech has started to prepare a reserve budget for expenses when hosting the 2023 SEA Games, and has begun to gradually reduce the money.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also advised to welcome the presence of foreign players closely, not to be allowed to leave, there is criticism that Cambodia is not close.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the reason for choosing Friday, May 05, 2023 to organize the SEA Games is because of the busy work in organizing the election and the 60th anniversary of independence
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also warned in advance not to comment on the organization of the SEA Games before the election to gain popularity.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that a total of nearly 60 foreign leaders, including 28 from Europe, 39 from Asia, including the Chairman of the Commission and the President of the European Council, will attend the Asia-Europe Summit in Cambodia in 2020.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the hosting of the ASEAN Summit in 2022 will be held only in Phnom Penh, not in Siem Reap and Sihanoukville.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he had announced that if people had an income of no more than $ 1,000, he would not host the SEA Games.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked those who mentioned that there is a Chinese military base in the Ream Sea, what is the real intention? Samdech Techo stated that before 1970, the presence of Vietnamese troops on Cambodian soil was discussed, followed by a coup d'état overthrowing Norodom Sihanouk. Iraq is accused of having weapons of mass destruction, but where is the weapons of mass destruction?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he had just decided to provide $ 40 million in addition to the previous $ 290 million to buy weapons from China to strengthen the capacity of the Cambodian army. * Samdech Techo Hun Sen mentioned the arrest of three cadastral officers. People in Pursat Province for Corruption Demand $ 100,000 from Builders
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in July, Cambodia received a total revenue of about 500 million US dollars from customs and taxes.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian economy in 2019 could be around 7.1 percent.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government of Cambodia is not rude and the budget is not just figures, it is real cash.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people to eat pork and not worry about African swine fever. Samdech Techo stated that Samdech also ate pork.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told the politicians to wait for Samdech to die because he had to live to defeat the traitors and keep the peace for another 40 years.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that politicians waiting for Samdech's death is the most important politics.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there are many laws that the United States has drafted in the past to impose sanctions on Vietnam, but never passed on Vietnam. Samdech Techo stated that if the US law passes sanctions on Cambodia, we do not care, nothing will affect Cambodia.
