Mr. Vy Samnang continued, "Currently, investors come to Cambodia from all walks of life in the world. For the territory in Kampong Speu, there are investors from up to 45 countries, mostly Chinese." So far in Cambodia, 251 factories are operating and more will appear in Kampong Speu.
