On that occasion, Mr. Veng Sakhu instructed the working group and party members to be active in the field to find out about the well-being and livelihood of the people and to find all means to meet the shortcomings or problems that he is facing, in particular. Must cooperate with local authorities to continue to implement the K3 program that has been set out to be consistent, effective and timely for them, such as birth certificates, death certificates and marriage certificates.
