After the meeting with the people in Prey Char commune on the same day, Mr. Veng Sakhon continued to talk with more than 300 people in Khnor Dambang commune, Cheung Prey district in Wat Khnor Dambang.
On that occasion, he informed the people about the progress of Cambodia from a country full of chronic civil war, the poorest, without food to supply its people, instability and incapacity to a country with complete peace, independence, freedom and democracy. Development in all fields, sufficient capacity to compete and be equal on the international stage.
He asked all people to continue to support and give confidence to Samdech Techo Hun Sen and the leaders of the Cambodian People's Party is certainly not wrong, and the Cambodian People's Party will continue to strive to sacrifice their physical and mental strength to serve. People do their best to ensure peace, social stability and especially sustainable development.
He said that all citizens also have a duty to participate in maintaining this wonderful peace, stability and unity, without listening to incitement, harassment, sharing exaggerated information that is propagated for social pollution or action. Any that is absolutely against Cambodian law.
In order to show the spirit and contribute to the local development on behalf of the Cambodian People's Party, Mr. Wen Sakhon handed over some funds for the construction of infrastructure around the commune, such as the rehabilitation of old canals and the digging of new canals for flood relief.
