Ms. Tri Dana, CEO of Dana Tri Cambodia Trading Co., Ltd., said that this is the first time that her company has organized such a large-scale gathering after seeing the new provincial distribution representatives. Great success in business.
In sharing her experience, Ms. Try Dana mentioned her real life, which was despised and struggled before becoming the owner of a company like today. "I used to be refused to sell because I was afraid I would not be able to repay the sale," she said. I was not angry at that time, but I told myself to always try and always hope that one day life will change.
At the same time, Ms. Try Dana also advised all Cambodian women to strengthen their personal capacity to have a job or business for themselves, should not rely on the salary or strength of her husband. The director general of the cosmetics company and the owner of the diamond shop added that if any Cambodian woman has no idea what business to contact, she will tell her how to sell and spend the least capital.
From the very beginning, Ms. Try Dana was just a seller of second-hand clothes and under the umbrella in front of the factory. In her life as an orphan, her parents have struggled since she was a child and saved some money to invest in a small business. Starting a business is like buying cosmetics from someone and then selling them at a certain price. But it is not easy because some people do not sell because they are afraid of debt.
As a person with big dreams, Try Dana did not end up with this goal, but explored a series of new businesses. At the same time, the CEO of this beauty company also remembers the gold and diamond jewelry for women's makeup. After trying to study it for several years, Try Dana decided to open another diamond shop called "Dana Jewelry" on May 22, 2019.
