Mr. Chin Bunthoeun said that the inauguration of the medical waste incinerator will make the medical waste service management unit play an important role in contributing to the preservation of the environment in Phnom Penh, which is working in conjunction with liquid waste. People already use this medical waste, it needs to be prepared to burn properly.
He added that the management of medical waste management services will play an important role in generating additional income to contribute to the humanitarian institutions of the Cambodian Red Cross branch in Phnom Penh, not only it is involved in the implementation of a common policy. Take care of the environment as well.
