(Tbong Khmum): Mr. Vong Soth, Minister of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation, said that our country is peaceful so we have the opportunity to build a nation for development. Indeed, freedom of belief through religious observance is a cornerstone of the peaceful development of the nation throughout the country under the right leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
