(Phnom Penh): The Anti-Corruption Unit (ACU) has disseminated the Anti-Corruption Law and the Law on the Amendment of the Anti-Corruption Law to the leadership of Chamkar Mon District in order to make officials and leaders understand and avoid committing acts. Corruption in its institutions.
