The Secretary of State also stated that a clean city depends on a clean environment, order, infrastructure, and a better living environment that provides warmth to the people and tourists. For a cleaner Cambodia, Green Cambodia, the Ministry of Tourism, as well as the Royal Government, has launched a "Clean City Competition Movement" in which women are also actively involved.
