(Pursat): Mr. Mao Thunin, Governor of Pursat Province, on July 25, 2019, inaugurated 5 ballet steel bridges in Chamkar Khluy village, Phsar Andet village, Chamkar O village, Otapong village, Bao Reang village and Prasat village. Romlech Commune and Otapong Commune, Bakan District, Pursat Province to facilitate the travel and transportation of agricultural products of the general population.
