The provincial governor said that under the care of the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, with Samdech Techo Hun Sen as the Prime Minister of Cambodia, has developed a number of physical infrastructure, such as the five steel ballet bridges and rubber roads. From Romlech commune to Otapong commune already.
